// Checks whether 17 is prime. Prints 1 if yes, 0 if no. //
VAR n
VAR d
VAR is_prime

LDA 17
STA n
LDA 2
STA d
LDA 1
STA is_prime

>check
  LDR d
  LDR n
  LTH
  JCN body
  JMP done

>body
  LDR n
  LDR d
  MOD
  LDA 0
  EQU
  JCN found

  LDR d
  INC
  STA d
  JMP check

>found
  LDA 0
  STA is_prime

>done
LDR is_prime
OUT
BRK